WEBVTT

01:26.720 --> 01:29.780
[Glory]

01:30.560 --> 01:32.979
[Episode 11]

01:34.120 --> 01:35.520
Mr. Yan, watch your step.

01:52.030 --> 01:53.680
Why are you so surprised?

01:54.120 --> 01:55.150
Didn't you know Grandmother

01:55.150 --> 01:57.680
invited me
to admire the moon tonight as well?

02:01.340 --> 02:02.800
I caught a cold yesterday.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.920
I'm afraid of passing it to Old Madam.

02:04.920 --> 02:07.520
Lady Yunxi,
please convey my apologies to her.

02:07.710 --> 02:08.970
I'll take my leave now.

02:09.550 --> 02:10.360
If you leave,

02:10.590 --> 02:11.920
how will I explain this?

02:13.860 --> 02:15.120
In families like ours,

02:15.760 --> 02:18.220
when have we ever
decided our own marriages?

02:18.430 --> 02:20.230
Or perhaps hold yourself so high

02:20.660 --> 02:22.380
that you look down on me?

02:26.910 --> 02:28.560
Lady Yunxi, you have extraordinary beauty

02:28.560 --> 02:29.960
and exceptional talent.

02:30.190 --> 02:31.030
How could I dare to have

02:31.030 --> 02:32.870
even the slightest contempt for you?

02:32.870 --> 02:33.590
Yan Bailou,

02:34.430 --> 02:36.290
do you truly insist on having her?

02:36.630 --> 02:37.890
Back in the mountains,

02:38.520 --> 02:41.170
I often tried to gain enlightenment
like my senior brothers.

02:41.170 --> 02:42.910
But being naturally slow-witted,

02:42.910 --> 02:44.310
I never gained anything.

02:45.150 --> 02:46.079
One night,

02:46.590 --> 02:49.310
I climbed to the mountaintop alone
and sat there.

02:49.310 --> 02:52.000
Seeing a bright star,
I suddenly became enlightened.

02:52.000 --> 02:52.930
I was overjoyed.

02:54.079 --> 02:55.470
This star holds

02:56.230 --> 02:57.960
extraordinary meaning for me.

02:58.840 --> 03:00.840
Lady Yunxi, though
you're as radiant as the bright moon

03:00.840 --> 03:02.400
and as dazzling as dawn's glow,

03:02.400 --> 03:03.360
you're ultimately not

03:03.360 --> 03:05.280
the star that brought me enlightenment.

03:05.280 --> 03:06.480
Forgive my rudeness.

03:10.920 --> 03:13.430
This man speaks like a Buddhist,

03:13.840 --> 03:15.770
but his mind is unfathomably deep.

03:15.980 --> 03:17.380
He's not easy to control.

03:18.240 --> 03:20.380
I'm determined to find
someone understanding,

03:20.380 --> 03:21.840
gentle, and considerate.

03:22.210 --> 03:22.750
I don't want to marry

03:22.750 --> 03:24.470
a monk with hair.

03:25.190 --> 03:26.590
Tell Grandmother for me,

03:26.710 --> 03:27.920
such an oddity

03:28.430 --> 03:29.490
is not to my liking.

03:30.430 --> 03:31.120
Lady Yunxi!

03:40.630 --> 03:42.000
Even with a body of iron and steel,

03:42.000 --> 03:43.560
can you ward off all misfortunes?

03:43.560 --> 03:46.290
Young Master, you must be
more careful next time.

03:47.170 --> 03:49.079
Is it here or there?

03:51.910 --> 03:53.170
It's not even swollen.

03:53.870 --> 03:54.960
Who says it's not swollen?

03:54.960 --> 03:56.280
Isn't this... This...

03:56.870 --> 03:58.670
Didn't your rubbing just fix it?

04:00.630 --> 04:02.090
Go fetch me some hot water.

04:02.410 --> 04:02.940
Alright.

04:17.070 --> 04:19.070
Young Master, the hot water is here.

04:21.300 --> 04:22.100
Young Master?

04:34.130 --> 04:39.060
♪ Who tears a strand
of light from the dark night? ♪

04:40.920 --> 04:45.920
♪ It jolts my already silent heart
awake ♪

04:47.650 --> 04:52.420
♪ The moon hangs bright,
as breezes dance among stars ♪

04:53.040 --> 04:58.870
♪ Hear the sighs
for the beauty's fleeting years ♪

04:59.750 --> 05:05.790
♪ Lost in the mortal world,
it fades into twilight ♪

05:06.300 --> 05:12.330
♪ Grass sprouts, orioles sing,
longevity slips away ♪

05:13.010 --> 05:18.930
♪ Love comes in scattered pairs,
yet thoughts linger on ♪

05:18.950 --> 05:25.420
♪ Drifting with the passing years ♪

05:25.850 --> 05:29.200
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

05:29.240 --> 05:32.409
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

05:32.700 --> 05:34.950
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

05:34.990 --> 05:39.060
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

05:39.240 --> 05:42.810
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

05:42.830 --> 05:45.850
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

05:45.920 --> 05:52.190
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

05:52.510 --> 05:59.950
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

06:18.510 --> 06:20.950
[Rong's Ancestral Temple]

06:54.600 --> 06:56.530
You kept me waiting all day in vain.

06:57.950 --> 06:59.630
Do you have nothing to say?

07:00.480 --> 07:01.740
Do you want to marry me?

07:02.120 --> 07:03.920
Are you having second thoughts?

07:04.750 --> 07:05.430
You personally agreed

07:05.430 --> 07:06.870
in front of everyone.

07:06.970 --> 07:08.160
If you go back on your word now,

07:08.160 --> 07:09.490
breaking your promise,

07:10.190 --> 07:11.360
how will the Rong family

07:11.360 --> 07:13.160
conduct business in the future?

07:14.950 --> 07:15.810
Light the lamp.

07:31.430 --> 07:32.310
Rong Shanbao,

07:33.920 --> 07:35.000
I have no interest

07:35.000 --> 07:37.390
in admiring your family's ancestral hall.

07:37.390 --> 07:38.909
Where did you go today?

07:39.480 --> 07:41.280
Do you know how long I've waited?

07:41.409 --> 07:42.530
I'm asking you.

07:45.390 --> 07:47.190
Didn't the Yang family tell you

07:48.120 --> 07:49.780
that to enter the Rong family,

07:50.310 --> 07:52.240
you must first control your temper

07:52.310 --> 07:53.360
and be obedient?

07:54.510 --> 07:55.390
Or perhaps

07:55.630 --> 07:56.960
they sent their son here

07:57.590 --> 07:59.720
deliberately to make enemies with us?

08:01.430 --> 08:04.490
You should understand your position
before speaking.

08:35.600 --> 08:37.400
I've seen many ancestral halls.

08:37.630 --> 08:39.570
What's so special about the Rong family's?

08:39.570 --> 08:41.549
This pair of dragon and phoenix pillars

08:41.549 --> 08:42.440
were originally two ancient trees

08:42.440 --> 08:43.909
growing on a cliff.

08:44.590 --> 08:46.050
They embraced each other,

08:46.270 --> 08:47.920
interdependent for 1,000 years,

08:47.920 --> 08:49.440
weathering countless storms,

08:49.440 --> 08:50.970
being lush and prosperous.

08:51.050 --> 08:53.180
Even their roots grew together as one.

08:53.550 --> 08:54.790
Yet ignorant villagers

08:54.790 --> 08:56.190
managed to cut them down.

08:56.510 --> 08:58.500
Our ancestors were deeply saddened,

08:58.500 --> 09:00.230
paid a fortune to acquire them,

09:00.440 --> 09:02.840
transported them
thousands of miles to Linji,

09:02.840 --> 09:04.320
and sought master craftsmen of the time

09:04.320 --> 09:06.320
to carve them into
the male and female pillars.

09:06.320 --> 09:07.850
The right pillar is female;

09:08.150 --> 09:09.480
the left pillar is male.

09:10.120 --> 09:12.520
They're the foundation
of the Rong family.

09:12.840 --> 09:15.270
We must come to worship
on the first day of every month,

09:15.270 --> 09:19.400
so that the descendants remember
the Rong family's ancestral teachings.

09:22.000 --> 09:23.530
What ancestral teachings?

09:24.600 --> 09:26.130
The male and female pillars

09:26.240 --> 09:28.360
which share the same root and origin
accompany and sustain each other,

09:28.360 --> 09:29.750
and neither can be missing.

09:29.750 --> 09:31.010
People are like trees,

09:31.510 --> 09:32.670
all born from nature

09:32.670 --> 09:33.870
and return to nature.

09:34.480 --> 09:36.150
For a family to flourish

09:36.670 --> 09:37.870
and prosper forever,

09:38.030 --> 09:38.790
one must find

09:38.790 --> 09:40.150
a compatible partner,

09:41.140 --> 09:44.870
sharing both joys and hardships,
bound together in life and death.

09:48.120 --> 09:50.120
Stop putting on an act in front of me.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.000
The Rong family may deceive others,

09:52.000 --> 09:52.910
but not me.

09:53.510 --> 09:55.030
Why do women run the household?

09:55.030 --> 09:56.150
Your grandfather is dead,

09:56.150 --> 09:57.840
but your father is still alive.

09:57.840 --> 09:59.130
There's also your second and third uncle.

09:59.130 --> 10:01.130
Why don't any of them run the family?

10:01.170 --> 10:02.320
Why do Rong's women

10:02.320 --> 10:03.650
refuse to hold wedding ceremonies,

10:03.650 --> 10:06.050
yet all the children
bear the Rong surname?

10:06.550 --> 10:08.590
Why was your aunt
who insisted on marrying out

10:08.590 --> 10:10.450
removed from the family registry

10:10.720 --> 10:12.580
and forbidden to return forever?

10:14.570 --> 10:15.960
I know where your Rong family

10:15.960 --> 10:17.480
ancestors came from.

10:17.910 --> 10:18.600
But since you've

10:18.600 --> 10:20.400
been here for hundreds of years,

10:20.790 --> 10:23.320
you shouldn't cling to
those outdated rules!

10:25.840 --> 10:27.120
I don't understand

10:27.830 --> 10:29.360
what you're talking about.

10:29.960 --> 10:32.080
My Rong family has adapted
to local customs.

10:32.080 --> 10:34.440
For hundreds of years, we've

10:34.630 --> 10:36.270
followed your rules.

10:37.150 --> 10:38.880
My third uncle has long passed.

10:39.030 --> 10:41.030
My father and second uncle
have successful official careers.

10:41.030 --> 10:43.840
Why should they restrict themselves
to being merchants?

10:43.840 --> 10:45.630
Since it's the woman
who takes a husband into the family,

10:45.630 --> 10:46.960
naturally the children

10:47.120 --> 10:48.380
bear the Rong surname.

10:49.120 --> 10:50.600
As for my aunt—

10:51.150 --> 10:53.030
aren't there many in Linji City
who defy their parents,

10:53.030 --> 10:54.000
elope, get married,

10:54.000 --> 10:56.460
and have been
expelled from their families?

10:56.750 --> 10:57.600
Mr. Yang,

10:58.460 --> 10:59.390
I brought you here

10:59.390 --> 11:00.390
to tell you:

11:01.280 --> 11:02.680
only men who are truly

11:03.270 --> 11:04.510
recognized by Rong women

11:04.510 --> 11:06.170
can enter the ancestral hall.

11:06.760 --> 11:08.760
I don't recognize you as my husband.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.630
You will never be able to enter

11:10.630 --> 11:12.160
the Rong's ancestral hall,

11:12.390 --> 11:12.870
nor can you

11:12.870 --> 11:14.890
stand by the male pillar for the wedding.

11:14.890 --> 11:16.370
Say that again.

11:16.870 --> 11:18.000
In your words,

11:18.510 --> 11:20.320
even with your threats and bribes,

11:20.320 --> 11:21.580
and all your scheming,

11:22.270 --> 11:23.870
you're not even a concubine.

11:24.160 --> 11:25.510
You have no status

11:26.030 --> 11:27.550
and will gain nothing.

11:53.070 --> 11:55.040
Fine.

11:58.410 --> 11:59.560
But don't forget,

12:01.270 --> 12:03.070
as long as I hold the secret,

12:04.710 --> 12:06.760
you have to be my woman obediently.

12:08.630 --> 12:10.440
You'll never escape this fate.

12:24.920 --> 12:25.950
Think about it.

12:26.910 --> 12:29.310
A secret enough
to destroy the Rong family.

12:31.530 --> 12:33.440
What will you use to shut my mouth?

12:36.280 --> 12:37.870
My public engagement to you

12:38.870 --> 12:40.800
was only to maintain appearances.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.300
Once the truth is exposed,

12:43.020 --> 12:45.440
how could your Yang family
remain unscathed?

12:45.440 --> 12:47.340
Disregarding both families'
reputation and honor

12:47.340 --> 12:49.600
for your personal feelings and grudges?

12:50.150 --> 12:51.210
When that happens,

12:51.980 --> 12:53.580
the first to demand your life

12:54.540 --> 12:55.570
will surely be the Yang family.

12:55.570 --> 12:57.230
I don't care about any of that.

12:58.840 --> 13:00.500
In order to please the Rong family,

13:00.500 --> 13:02.900
they forced me here
by any means necessary.

13:02.910 --> 13:03.750
Why should I

13:03.750 --> 13:05.080
care about their lives?

13:05.870 --> 13:06.670
I've won.

13:07.990 --> 13:08.750
I'm here now.

13:10.820 --> 13:12.320
So you can only be mine.

13:13.670 --> 13:15.340
The 25th is an auspicious day,

13:15.520 --> 13:18.050
and we'll consummate
our wedding that night.

13:18.720 --> 13:21.150
Otherwise, if I risk disgrace
and make a scene,

13:21.150 --> 13:23.240
everyone will lose face.

13:30.640 --> 13:32.040
You're truly beautiful—

13:33.320 --> 13:35.450
beautiful enough to capture my heart.

15:06.590 --> 15:09.060
[Rong Mansion]

15:18.790 --> 15:20.510
Young Master,
why don't we rest for a while?

15:20.510 --> 15:21.440
It won't kill me.

15:21.960 --> 15:22.490
Let's go.

15:23.090 --> 15:23.810
Keep going.

15:25.240 --> 15:26.700
When your leg gets better,

15:27.600 --> 15:30.460
accompany me to offer incense
at my mother's grave.

15:30.910 --> 15:32.870
You mean your mother who was a maid?

15:33.410 --> 15:35.210
Your grandmother despised her.

15:35.810 --> 15:37.740
I advise you not to stir up trouble.

15:38.320 --> 15:39.530
Our marriage

15:40.080 --> 15:41.880
must be reported to our parents.

15:42.320 --> 15:43.600
Even if Grandmother knows about it,

15:43.600 --> 15:45.130
I don't think she will mind.

15:51.510 --> 15:54.040
Mr. He, since you want
to join the Rong family,

15:54.190 --> 15:55.720
are you willing to marry me?

16:00.600 --> 16:01.270
Alright.

16:03.960 --> 16:04.720
Lady Yunshu,

16:06.200 --> 16:07.530
I agreed to this engagement

16:07.530 --> 16:09.000
only as a temporary measure.

16:09.000 --> 16:10.510
You don't actually believe

16:10.510 --> 16:12.430
that I, a noble son of the He family,

16:12.430 --> 16:14.710
would marry a maid's daughter, do you?

16:15.360 --> 16:18.480
And you want me to offer incense
and pay respects with you?

16:18.480 --> 16:19.680
Are you even worth it?

16:20.840 --> 16:23.840
Aren't you afraid of
bringing bad luck upon yourself?

16:26.820 --> 16:28.350
Yes, this is such good news.

16:29.790 --> 16:30.320
Let's go.

16:31.030 --> 16:31.630
Come on.

16:32.030 --> 16:34.200
The young master
will scold us if we're late.

16:34.200 --> 16:34.930
Who's there?

16:34.960 --> 16:35.790
My Lady,

16:36.200 --> 16:37.150
they're from the Yang family,

16:37.150 --> 16:40.080
going to Qilan Garden
to prepare the bridal chamber.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.440
Though you're blind,

16:44.070 --> 16:45.470
your mind is quite clear.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.320
Could you not know that Yang Dingchen

16:47.320 --> 16:49.050
is going to marry Rong Shanbao?

16:49.960 --> 16:50.720
Don't worry.

16:51.680 --> 16:52.920
She and I are mortal enemies,

16:52.920 --> 16:54.720
incompatible as fire and water.

16:54.870 --> 16:57.000
I wouldn't deign to spare her a glance.

16:59.150 --> 17:00.680
The spring chill is biting.

17:00.970 --> 17:02.540
Your lady is so sickly.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.800
Take her back inside

17:04.530 --> 17:06.790
before she collapses and blames others.

17:08.380 --> 17:09.180
Such a burden.

17:11.890 --> 17:12.480
Go away!

17:13.430 --> 17:14.560
I'm perfectly fine.

17:54.930 --> 17:55.550
My Lady.

18:00.360 --> 18:01.860
The wind is so strong today.

18:01.860 --> 18:02.930
How many peach blossoms

18:02.930 --> 18:04.670
can withstand such destruction?

18:04.670 --> 18:06.800
Go collect some peach blossom petals.

18:16.110 --> 18:16.590
In all the world,

18:16.590 --> 18:18.350
I've only heard of the bride's family
preparing the marital chamber,

18:18.350 --> 18:20.150
never seen a man so eager to do it.

18:20.350 --> 18:21.750
It's obvious that Lady Shanbao
finds him irritating,

18:21.750 --> 18:23.160
yet he still clings to her.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.690
What a shameless creature.

18:26.340 --> 18:27.240
Isn't this

18:27.240 --> 18:28.220
what she brought upon herself?

18:28.220 --> 18:29.740
What kind of difficulty

18:30.030 --> 18:31.630
could possibly trouble her?

18:40.160 --> 18:41.360
Prepare the chamber.

18:56.020 --> 18:56.460
I...

18:56.670 --> 18:57.250
Manzhu.

19:15.370 --> 19:17.240
Do you people from the Yang family
know proper etiquette?

19:17.240 --> 19:18.200
Our lady's cosmetic case

19:18.200 --> 19:19.460
is not for you to touch!

19:33.790 --> 19:34.590
Lady Shanbao,

19:34.920 --> 19:35.640
last night at midnight,

19:35.640 --> 19:36.890
the spring rain came too suddenly

19:36.890 --> 19:37.830
and flooded the newly dug

19:37.830 --> 19:38.890
drainage ditches.

19:38.990 --> 19:40.270
In the newly opende tea plantation
on the back hill,

19:40.270 --> 19:41.400
the tea workers neglected

19:41.400 --> 19:42.220
to cover the sown

19:42.220 --> 19:43.680
tea seeds with rice straw.

19:44.510 --> 19:45.910
Let's go take a look.

19:52.310 --> 19:54.040
You must return early tonight.

19:55.680 --> 19:58.540
I'll be waiting
to consummate our wedding with you.

20:07.720 --> 20:08.250
Let's go.

20:14.940 --> 20:15.730
Where is Yi?

20:16.140 --> 20:17.870
Why didn't you report earlier?

20:27.270 --> 20:29.000
Why are you all standing there?

20:30.070 --> 20:31.880
Hurry up and get everything ready.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.360
If you ruin my wedding,

20:34.750 --> 20:36.440
I'll skin you alive!

21:27.570 --> 21:28.300
What's this?

21:35.680 --> 21:37.590
Why isn't Mr. He accompanying you?

21:37.590 --> 21:38.920
Leaving you here alone.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.000
Is he

21:42.260 --> 21:43.590
not treating you well?

21:44.830 --> 21:45.720
Since ancient times, the wealthy

21:45.720 --> 21:46.980
have favored peonies.

21:47.800 --> 21:48.720
You scholars

21:48.720 --> 21:50.680
admire pine, bamboo, plum, and orchid.

21:50.680 --> 21:52.750
These peach blossoms
are common everywhere,

21:52.750 --> 21:54.010
vulgar and frivolous,

21:54.680 --> 21:56.880
so naturally they aren't appreciated.

21:57.200 --> 21:58.600
Mr. He is proud by nature.

21:58.880 --> 22:01.160
If he hadn't wanted
to stay with the Rong family,

22:01.160 --> 22:03.090
he would never have proposed to me.

22:03.390 --> 22:04.500
I misunderstood.

22:13.690 --> 22:14.550
Lady Yunshu, you don't need to

22:14.550 --> 22:15.920
use these tactics on me.

22:18.160 --> 22:20.220
Whatever you want me to do to help you,

22:20.400 --> 22:21.230
I'm willing.

22:52.010 --> 22:52.920
It's the first time

22:52.920 --> 22:54.580
I've known what you look like.

23:22.400 --> 23:23.860
I'm done. I have things to do.

23:23.860 --> 23:24.340
Don't.

23:25.510 --> 23:26.310
Mr. Yan.

23:27.130 --> 23:27.680
Don't go.

23:27.820 --> 23:28.250
You...

23:29.590 --> 23:30.290
Do you expect

23:30.290 --> 23:31.850
me to just stand by and watch my cousin

23:31.850 --> 23:33.650
fall into the hands of that wolf?

23:33.790 --> 23:35.030
Can't you see?

23:35.440 --> 23:37.000
The Yang family is naturally treacherous.

23:37.000 --> 23:38.640
There must be something fishy going on.

23:38.640 --> 23:39.200
My cousin

23:39.310 --> 23:40.710
doesn't want this at all.

23:41.710 --> 23:42.710
You can't stop it.

23:42.830 --> 23:44.290
Even if I can't, I must try!

23:44.350 --> 23:45.160
If you go now,

23:46.510 --> 23:48.110
you'll only cause more chaos

23:48.210 --> 23:50.210
and add to Lady Shanbao's troubles.

23:50.600 --> 23:52.330
Lady Shanbao has her own plans.

23:52.420 --> 23:55.120
She won't be easily manipulated
by Yang Dingchen.

23:55.120 --> 23:57.030
Let's just wait and see.

24:15.610 --> 24:16.410
You're such

24:16.960 --> 24:18.830
a magnanimous person, aren't you?

24:18.830 --> 24:20.950
Is this what people mean by

24:21.630 --> 24:22.970
"those truly detached from love

24:22.970 --> 24:24.600
knows neither worry nor fear"?

24:24.600 --> 24:26.060
Sometimes I really wonder

24:26.520 --> 24:28.610
if either you don't love my cousin,

24:29.030 --> 24:30.840
or you're made of wood and stone!

24:30.870 --> 24:32.530
You simply don't have a heart!

24:40.980 --> 24:42.580
You don't need to provoke me.

24:43.720 --> 24:46.350
Of course I feel jealousy and resentment.

24:47.270 --> 24:48.730
But I know self-restraint

24:49.390 --> 24:50.650
and not to hurt others.

24:51.770 --> 24:53.510
To vent one's personal emotions

24:53.510 --> 24:55.760
and cause endless trouble for others...

24:55.760 --> 24:56.960
Such terrifying love

24:57.640 --> 24:58.590
will only make you

24:58.590 --> 24:59.920
more despicable

25:00.360 --> 25:01.400
and annoying.

25:02.310 --> 25:02.920
In the end,

25:03.870 --> 25:05.000
everything you love

25:06.510 --> 25:07.270
and long for

25:10.160 --> 25:11.590
will slip away like sand,

25:13.030 --> 25:14.070
never to return.

25:56.400 --> 25:58.160
Miss, you have such good taste.

25:58.490 --> 25:59.890
This looks so beautiful.

26:03.840 --> 26:05.270
This suits you so well.

26:05.600 --> 26:06.440
It's lovely.

26:08.950 --> 26:10.680
This blue is really beautiful.

26:24.950 --> 26:26.480
Let's go to the East Market.

26:37.060 --> 26:38.720
Change course. Head to the dock.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.380
Steward Lu.

26:40.030 --> 26:40.920
Just do as I say.

26:42.530 --> 26:43.390
Change course.

27:09.980 --> 27:10.780
Ms. Yan,

27:11.130 --> 27:13.060
Lady Shanbao hasn't returned yet.

27:14.030 --> 27:15.230
Usually by this time,

27:15.360 --> 27:16.730
Lady Shanbao should be at Chongxi Hall

27:16.730 --> 27:18.390
having dinner with Old Madam.

27:18.680 --> 27:20.280
How has she not returned yet?

27:20.940 --> 27:21.400
Guanyu.

27:23.510 --> 27:25.200
The people who followed her
haven't returned either.

27:25.200 --> 27:26.120
I've already sent someone

27:26.120 --> 27:27.850
to the tea plantation for news.

27:29.550 --> 27:31.880
Perhaps she's been delayed by something.

27:32.880 --> 27:34.920
Hurry to the entrance and wait for her.

27:34.920 --> 27:35.400
Yes.

27:50.790 --> 27:51.790
Make way, please.

27:57.000 --> 27:57.510
My Lady,

28:10.920 --> 28:12.320
I was afraid the market is too crowded.

28:12.320 --> 28:13.220
In case some careless person

28:13.220 --> 28:14.020
bumps into you

28:14.240 --> 28:15.630
and ruins your enjoyment,

28:15.630 --> 28:16.630
I took the liberty

28:17.020 --> 28:19.220
of asking the driver to take this route.

28:20.000 --> 28:21.130
If you don't like it,

28:21.400 --> 28:22.580
we can reach the end of this road

28:22.580 --> 28:24.310
and still go to the East Market.

28:28.780 --> 28:29.190
Come.

28:30.070 --> 28:30.500
Wait.

28:31.370 --> 28:32.770
Who said I want to go back?

28:50.790 --> 28:51.590
My Lady.

28:51.720 --> 28:52.720
Wait on the shore.

28:53.620 --> 28:53.980
I...

28:54.190 --> 28:54.650
Please.

29:06.270 --> 29:07.180
What should we do?

29:07.180 --> 29:08.600
He's always surrounded by people.

29:08.600 --> 29:10.330
We can't find the right moment.

29:10.440 --> 29:12.500
Let's go report back
to His Lordship.

30:19.030 --> 30:21.490
What made you think of
taking a night cruise?

30:25.950 --> 30:28.280
You've always been busy and hardworking.

30:28.590 --> 30:30.290
Sometimes you should sit by the lake

30:30.290 --> 30:32.420
to relieve your troubles and worries.

30:36.160 --> 30:37.030
I've never had

30:37.030 --> 30:38.690
such a peaceful state of mind.

30:39.750 --> 30:41.470
Nor have I ever had the leisure

30:42.140 --> 30:43.600
to sit aimlessly on a boat.

30:44.420 --> 30:45.750
Just now as I stood here,

30:46.590 --> 30:47.790
I was thinking about

30:48.620 --> 30:50.350
how to put that filthy creature

30:50.950 --> 30:52.950
in a sack with a large stone

30:54.030 --> 30:55.960
and sink him right here in the lake.

31:00.550 --> 31:02.840
So you want to rid the people of evil?

31:05.880 --> 31:07.610
Would you like me to be a helper?

31:08.330 --> 31:09.730
If I were to kill someone,

31:10.270 --> 31:11.600
would you bury the body?

31:11.980 --> 31:12.590
Yes.

31:14.430 --> 31:16.360
It's kind of you to repay kindness,

31:17.350 --> 31:17.880
but I'm not

31:17.880 --> 31:19.610
a bandit who robs and plunders.

31:20.140 --> 31:22.140
What bodies would I need you to bury?

31:23.030 --> 31:23.920
I'm so worried

31:24.690 --> 31:26.420
precisely because you're not.

31:27.030 --> 31:27.680
There are

31:28.440 --> 31:29.070
men in this world

31:29.070 --> 31:30.530
with sinister intentions

31:30.610 --> 31:32.410
who will pursue you by any means.

31:32.790 --> 31:34.240
If you're tough in speech but soft-hearted

31:34.240 --> 31:35.100
and show mercy,

31:35.510 --> 31:37.440
I'm afraid you'll suffer greatly.

31:37.590 --> 31:39.920
For example, the one staying in your room.

31:40.120 --> 31:42.960
Lady Shanbao,
are you really going to marry him?

31:46.360 --> 31:47.200
Why do you ask?

31:48.240 --> 31:49.100
Don't you know?

31:51.170 --> 31:52.700
And if I did know, what then?

31:54.750 --> 31:55.240
Does

31:56.170 --> 31:57.160
this outsider of

31:57.160 --> 31:58.020
unknown origin

31:58.240 --> 32:00.040
not deserve the Rong household?

32:00.850 --> 32:01.910
I never meant that.

32:02.610 --> 32:03.480
Although I don't remember

32:03.480 --> 32:04.480
where I come from,

32:05.540 --> 32:07.430
I've sneaked in your family's library

32:07.430 --> 32:08.290
which is famous

32:09.170 --> 32:10.430
throughout Jiangnan.

32:11.320 --> 32:15.520
Classics, history, military,
agriculture, divination...

32:16.190 --> 32:18.320
I've read 9,000 of the 10,000 volumes.

32:18.510 --> 32:19.750
It seems I must have

32:19.750 --> 32:21.350
studied diligently in my past.

32:21.350 --> 32:23.480
Perhaps I even held an official title.

32:23.480 --> 32:25.310
Just now, as our boat passed,

32:25.710 --> 32:27.650
I easily identified errors
in the flute playing,

32:27.650 --> 32:29.450
showing I'm versed in music too.

32:29.590 --> 32:32.440
Many have come to the Rong Mansion
seeking marriage,

32:32.440 --> 32:34.630
but where can you find another

32:35.430 --> 32:37.250
who excels in flute, chess,
calligraphy, and painting,

32:37.250 --> 32:38.350
skilled in both civil and martial arts,

32:38.350 --> 32:39.720
willing to share your burdens

32:39.720 --> 32:41.380
and even give his life for you?

32:42.440 --> 32:43.090
By rights,

32:43.970 --> 32:46.030
I should leave the Rong family immediately

32:46.030 --> 32:47.830
and return to propose
after finding my identity.

32:47.830 --> 32:48.590
But I fear...

32:52.850 --> 32:54.370
I fear when I return,

32:56.430 --> 32:58.630
you'll already belong to someone else.

33:02.110 --> 33:02.770
Lu Fusheng.

33:02.920 --> 33:04.920
I'm well-read and good at business.

33:05.210 --> 33:06.240
I can even grasp well

33:06.240 --> 33:07.440
the ways of the world and human hearts,

33:07.440 --> 33:08.400
but the one thing I can't figure out

33:08.400 --> 33:09.240
is your heart.

33:10.210 --> 33:12.720
Why are you kind one moment,
distant the next,

33:12.720 --> 33:14.550
sometimes changing your attitude?

33:14.550 --> 33:16.270
It's so unpredictable.

33:18.220 --> 33:20.020
But since I've set my heart on you

33:20.450 --> 33:21.510
and made up my mind,

33:23.320 --> 33:25.040
whether it leads to success or failure,

33:25.040 --> 33:25.790
even if I end up

33:25.790 --> 33:26.640
utterly defeated

33:26.640 --> 33:27.700
and empty-handed,

33:30.440 --> 33:31.300
I'll accept it.

33:31.790 --> 33:35.150
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

33:35.180 --> 33:38.350
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

33:38.650 --> 33:40.900
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

33:40.930 --> 33:45.000
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

33:45.180 --> 33:48.750
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

33:47.900 --> 33:48.770
Don't waste your effort.

33:48.770 --> 33:51.800
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

33:49.920 --> 33:51.250
Serving the Rong family

33:51.860 --> 33:58.130
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

33:51.880 --> 33:53.610
or even risking your life for it

33:53.790 --> 33:55.650
will bring you generous rewards.

33:57.270 --> 33:59.000
But if you marry a Rong's woman,

33:59.880 --> 34:00.960
perhaps one day

34:01.880 --> 34:03.110
your intelligence and decisiveness

34:03.110 --> 34:04.510
will turn into scheming.

34:05.340 --> 34:06.640
Even someone fair and tolerant

34:06.640 --> 34:08.500
can develop jealousy and hatred.

34:08.880 --> 34:11.010
Once you provoke your wife's disgust,

34:11.260 --> 34:13.980
you'll be mercilessly expelled
from the Rong family.

34:13.980 --> 34:15.380
Just like my grandfather

34:16.920 --> 34:18.650
and my cousins' grandfathers.

34:19.840 --> 34:20.590
Does Rong Shanbao

34:20.590 --> 34:22.190
have several grandfathers?

34:25.179 --> 34:27.280
You know nothing about the Rong family,

34:27.280 --> 34:28.679
nor do you understand me.

34:29.130 --> 34:30.060
Being my husband

34:30.350 --> 34:32.480
is the most difficult job in the world.

34:33.840 --> 34:34.500
Lu Fusheng,

34:35.840 --> 34:37.100
let's just be friends.

34:39.310 --> 34:40.969
I don't want to be your friend,

34:42.409 --> 34:43.210
Lady Shanbao,

34:46.630 --> 34:47.800
I want to marry you.

34:48.880 --> 34:52.230
♪ Flowers bloom and wither,
the sun climbs and falls ♪

34:52.260 --> 34:55.429
♪ True feelings are like drifting mist ♪

34:53.590 --> 34:54.190
Look.

34:55.000 --> 34:55.630
It's so beautiful.

34:55.630 --> 34:56.840
It looks gorgeous. So pretty.

34:55.730 --> 34:57.980
♪ People only know loneliness ♪

34:57.070 --> 34:57.960
So beautiful.

34:58.010 --> 35:02.080
♪ Who cares about karma's twist? ♪

34:59.840 --> 35:00.640
It's amazing.

35:01.230 --> 35:01.890
Look, look.

35:02.260 --> 35:05.830
♪ Tides ebb and flow,
the moon swells and shrinks ♪

35:03.190 --> 35:04.390
This color is lovely.

35:05.190 --> 35:06.480
It's so beautiful.

35:05.860 --> 35:08.880
♪ I see through, yet hold my tongue ♪

35:08.000 --> 35:08.940
I'll bring you here again.

35:08.940 --> 35:15.220
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

35:09.670 --> 35:10.870
We should make a wish.

35:11.000 --> 35:11.440
Yes.

35:12.880 --> 35:14.010
Yes, make a wish now.

35:15.600 --> 35:24.790
♪ Too fragile to be put into words ♪

35:32.360 --> 35:33.290
I should go back.

35:57.000 --> 36:01.670
♪ Get caught in a heavy, wild snowfall ♪

36:01.740 --> 36:05.480
♪ Watch magpies fluttering past my eyes ♪

36:05.670 --> 36:09.830
♪ It's tormenting itself all alone ♪

36:09.890 --> 36:13.990
♪ Unable to find any peers
for a get-together ♪

36:14.350 --> 36:18.510
♪ Wait for a perfectly full moon ♪

36:18.520 --> 36:22.810
♪ Yet every slice of it seems incomplete ♪

36:22.850 --> 36:26.820
♪ Is it because my prayers
are too presumptuous? ♪

36:27.060 --> 36:31.830
♪ Or do I lack a bit
of the sacrificial blood? ♪

36:30.970 --> 36:32.830
Lady Shanbao, you're finally...

36:36.490 --> 36:41.000
♪ The biting cold wind
makes me stumble as I run ♪

36:41.020 --> 36:45.410
♪ Laughing innocently,
I find my spirit broken ♪

36:45.670 --> 36:48.090
♪ Just like this,
I'm drunk in a spring night ♪

36:48.130 --> 36:50.770
♪ Just like this,
I'm lost in enduring hardships ♪

36:50.980 --> 36:53.550
♪ Intertwined with you ♪

36:53.570 --> 36:57.830
♪ No longer fret over who loves more ♪

36:57.280 --> 36:57.860
Lady Shanbao.

36:57.860 --> 37:02.430
♪ Gradually rid myself
of the snakes and scorpions in my heart ♪

37:03.180 --> 37:06.380
♪ Drink a cup
filled with bold passion ♪

37:06.410 --> 37:10.230
♪ Sing a line
about lovebirds and butterflies ♪

37:10.670 --> 37:14.220
♪ Put an end to all karmic ties and sins ♪

37:59.360 --> 37:59.840
My Lady.

38:00.870 --> 38:02.800
Lady Shanbao told you
to look after Lady Yunwan.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.800
That's your duty.

38:04.210 --> 38:04.840
Go now.

38:07.510 --> 38:07.840
I...

38:09.000 --> 38:09.280
I...

38:49.070 --> 38:49.870
Lady Shanbao,

38:50.310 --> 38:51.240
why are you here?

38:51.760 --> 38:54.150
I suddenly remembered
you painting on the boat earlier,

38:54.150 --> 38:55.350
evasively hiding it,

38:55.360 --> 38:56.690
unwilling to let me see.

38:58.510 --> 38:59.880
You must have a secret.

39:00.680 --> 39:01.810
I had to come and ask.

39:02.140 --> 39:02.870
My feelings

39:03.320 --> 39:05.230
have already been honestly
shared with you.

39:05.230 --> 39:07.090
There's nothing I can't tell you.

39:14.190 --> 39:15.320
If you want to see it,

39:15.830 --> 39:16.460
here it is.

39:26.520 --> 39:27.660
What do you

39:28.230 --> 39:29.430
keep my portrait for?

39:40.920 --> 39:42.020
There are already plenty

39:42.020 --> 39:43.760
offering poems and paintings around you.

39:43.760 --> 39:45.420
My attention hardly matters.

39:45.780 --> 39:46.910
I keep it for company

39:47.240 --> 39:48.900
on this lonely moonlit night.

39:57.120 --> 39:57.440
You...

39:57.440 --> 39:58.240
Lady Shanbao.

39:58.540 --> 39:58.910
Wait,

39:59.700 --> 40:00.170
I...

40:07.720 --> 40:08.280
Tonight,

40:09.160 --> 40:10.490
what... what are you...

40:34.840 --> 40:38.040
On this lonely moonlit night,
a portrait has no feelings.

40:38.330 --> 40:40.330
Even if you burn
three incense sticks daily

40:40.330 --> 40:41.930
and pray devoutly every day,

40:42.370 --> 40:44.500
a paper figure will never come to life.

40:45.460 --> 40:47.520
I've come to keep you company tonight

40:47.910 --> 40:49.640
and comfort your lonely heart.

40:49.970 --> 40:50.830
What do you say?

40:56.650 --> 40:58.750
I dare not accept your kindness.

41:28.430 --> 41:28.950
Why?

41:30.590 --> 41:32.250
Were all your words on the boat

41:34.320 --> 41:35.240
just lies?

41:36.630 --> 41:37.810
All those words
I spoke on the boat tonight

41:37.810 --> 41:39.400
came from the bottom of my heart.

41:39.400 --> 41:40.830
But with no matchmaker
and no marriage pledge

41:40.830 --> 41:41.960
settled between us,

41:42.030 --> 41:43.890
I dare not overstep even slightly

41:44.080 --> 41:44.890
to offend you.

42:02.990 --> 42:04.790
As long as both of us are willing,

42:05.000 --> 42:06.860
what's wrong with overstepping?

42:08.080 --> 42:09.440
After all, matchmakers can be changed,

42:09.440 --> 42:10.880
engagements can be broken,

42:10.880 --> 42:12.080
couples can divorce,

42:12.450 --> 42:13.910
and lovers can grow apart.

42:14.320 --> 42:16.320
Nothing remains constant forever.

42:16.550 --> 42:18.080
As long as we love each other

42:18.230 --> 42:19.890
and our hearts are connected,

42:20.030 --> 42:22.290
let the bright moon above be our witness,

42:22.510 --> 42:25.020
the magnolia tree at the door
our matchmaker,

42:25.020 --> 42:27.200
the passing spring breeze our officiant,

42:27.200 --> 42:29.330
and the frost on the ground our guests.

42:35.420 --> 42:36.950
What's wrong with becoming

42:37.220 --> 42:38.680
husband and wife tonight?

42:38.980 --> 42:39.580
But...

42:40.760 --> 42:42.690
I don't even know where I come from.

42:43.380 --> 42:44.440
Aren't you afraid?

42:45.600 --> 42:47.690
What if I'm a desperate outlaw?

42:48.190 --> 42:49.920
What if I've killed officials?

42:50.490 --> 42:51.860
What if I have enemies everywhere?

42:51.860 --> 42:52.460
What if...

42:54.090 --> 42:55.690
What if I'm not a good person?

43:09.770 --> 43:11.630
I've chosen the person before me,

43:12.260 --> 43:14.170
at this moment,

43:15.180 --> 43:16.270
in this place.

43:19.760 --> 43:21.160
As for what you did before

43:21.880 --> 43:22.990
or where you came from,

43:22.990 --> 43:23.720
I don't care.

43:24.580 --> 43:26.180
As long as you never deceive,

43:26.550 --> 43:27.110
cheat,

43:27.800 --> 43:29.060
or hide things from me,

43:29.630 --> 43:30.490
that's enough.

43:38.360 --> 43:38.880
Then...

43:40.360 --> 43:42.820
when you speak of
becoming husband and wife,

43:43.050 --> 43:44.820
do you mean just with me,

43:45.480 --> 43:47.280
or with that Yang fellow as well?

43:48.920 --> 43:50.070
Even the sight of him

43:50.070 --> 43:50.800
disgusts me.

43:51.230 --> 43:52.690
How could I ever marry him?

43:55.350 --> 43:56.030
Then if you become

43:56.030 --> 43:57.430
husband and wife with me,

43:58.440 --> 43:59.500
is it for one night,

44:00.280 --> 44:00.960
one month,

44:02.280 --> 44:03.280
or a lifetime?

44:05.100 --> 44:05.870
Well...

46:40.040 --> 46:42.470
[Milk Tea]

46:45.100 --> 46:47.430
You've always been busy and hardworking.

46:47.720 --> 46:49.430
You should occasionally sit by the lake

46:49.430 --> 46:51.490
to relieve your worries and sorrows.

46:53.360 --> 46:57.300
[Invented in ancient times, the milk tea
isn't just a modern dating essential.]

46:53.480 --> 46:54.400
According to
"The Family History of Marquis Ye",

46:54.400 --> 46:55.630
the milk tea in the Tang Dynasty

46:55.630 --> 46:58.000
contained milk curds
and was sprinkled with Sichuan pepper,

46:58.000 --> 46:59.200
with a salty and spicy kick.

46:59.200 --> 47:01.600
The poet Li Bi used "glazed eyes"

47:01.340 --> 47:05.000
[Poem by Li Bi from Tang Dynasty]

47:01.630 --> 47:03.670
to describe the wonderful effect

47:03.670 --> 47:05.320
of milk curds mixed with tea foam.

47:05.320 --> 47:07.050
Later, northwestern herdsmen

47:07.150 --> 47:10.070
used brick tea with cow or sheep milk,

47:10.440 --> 47:12.110
adding salt or butter

47:12.110 --> 47:13.760
to make salty milk tea,

47:13.760 --> 47:15.400
cutting greasiness and warding off cold.

47:15.400 --> 47:16.670
It became an essential drink

47:16.670 --> 47:17.880
in high-altitude cold regions,

47:17.880 --> 47:19.110
and could be considered

47:19.110 --> 47:20.920
the earliest dietary fiber supplement.

47:20.920 --> 47:22.630
Later, when tea was introduced to Europe,

47:22.630 --> 47:25.000
the British added milk and sugar,

47:25.000 --> 47:27.510
creating sweet English milk tea.

47:27.590 --> 47:28.190
Today,

47:28.400 --> 47:30.440
milk tea blends
Eastern and Western cultures,

47:30.440 --> 47:31.880
becoming a fashionable beverage

47:31.880 --> 47:32.800
popular worldwide.
